        "style": "bg-white",
        "heading": "Revolutionary ‘Nano adsorption’ filter technology",
        "content": "<p>Traditional filters simply trap unwanted pollutants, allowing them to accumulate and multiply where they become a breeding ground for bacteria within just two weeks - instantly contaminating any water that passes through it. To solve this crucial problem, we’ve developed revolutionary ‘Nano adsorption’ technology. How does it work?<br/><br/>First, we use granular activated carbon derived from natural coconut husks to remove chemicals, toxins, and heavy metals such as zinc and lead. Then we’ve impregnated every filter with carbon adsorbents to prevent bacteria growth inside the filter itself. This filtration process mimics nature and leaves oxygen and mineral contents unchanged, which gives our water a spring-like freshness and wholesome taste that’s second to none.</p>",
        "buttonlink": "",
        "buttontext": "",
        "afterbutton": "",
        "custom_id": ""
      }
    },
