      "type": "copy-image",
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-white",
        "layout": "copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "Why risk ingesting harmful toxins when you can drink fresh, clean water that’s completely safe?",
        "content": "<p>Your tap water could easily be contaminated without you knowing. Germs and chemicals come from nearby farms, sewage overflows, industrial operations or even stormwater. Bacteria and chemicals such as lead, copper, nitrate, giardia and E. coli can leach into your drinking water at the water’s source, or in the distribution system after the water has already been treated!<br/><br/>Why take the risk when you don’t know exactly what’s lurking in your drinking water? Phoenix Gravity Water Filters can take dirty water and eliminate 99.9% of contaminants instantly. It tastes great and you get peace of mind knowing it’s safe for the whole family to drink!</p>",
        "video_id": "",
